  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Bio-Energizing</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Lucas_Bishop_%28Earth-616%29_004.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171117142433\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lucas Bishop (Earth-616) 004\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Lucas_Bishop_%28Earth-616%29_004.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171117142433\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Lucas_Bishop_%28Earth-616%29_004.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171117142433 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Lucas_Bishop_%28Earth-616%29_004.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20171117142433 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lucas Bishop (Earth-616) 004\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Lucas_Bishop_%28Earth-616%29_004.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Lucas Bishop (Earth-616) 004.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Lucas Bishop (Marvel Comics) can bodily energize himself from absorbing the ambient energy around him.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be bio-enhanced by ambient energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>bio-absorb ambient energy to improve the bodily functions</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can bio-energetically absorb ambient energy and enhance themselves, converting it into bodily energy to perform superhuman feats.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Matter Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Factory\" title=\"Living Factory\">Living Factory</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Attribute_Augmentation\" title=\"Bodily Attribute Augmentation\">Bodily Attribute Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Supernatural\">Supernatural Body</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Empowerment\" title=\"Energy Empowerment\">Energy Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Semi-Immortality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Semi-Immortality\">Semi-Immortality</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May need to keep absorbing energy over periods of time to maintain biological stability.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Nathaniel Adams/Captain Atom (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Amy Sue Allen/Bombshell (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Clifford Zmeck/Major Force (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Sebastian Shaw (<i>X-Men: First Class</i>)</li>\n<li>Lucas Bishop (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/J%C5%ABgo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Jūgo\">Jūgo</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Kabuto_Yakushi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Kabuto Yakushi\">Kabuto Yakushi</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260731111542\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\n